1
00:00:01,473 --> 00:00:04,476
I can't stop thinking about
what happened last night.

2
00:00:05,213 --> 00:00:06,339
Must've been good.

3
00:00:07,674 --> 00:00:08,800
Yeah...

4
00:00:10,927 --> 00:00:14,806
Do you think it's okay
if I train with Jeong-min Lee?

5
00:00:15,348 --> 00:00:16,474
Why?

6
00:00:19,991 --> 00:00:22,244
He looked at me
kind of weird...

7
00:00:23,148 --> 00:00:25,108
Probably
just your imagination.

8
00:00:25,108 --> 00:00:27,736
That guy has
a good reputation.

9
00:00:27,736 --> 00:00:29,195
And hey

10
00:00:29,195 --> 00:00:31,489
learning from a pro
isn't a bad thing.

11
00:00:31,489 --> 00:00:33,158
True.

12
00:00:38,705 --> 00:00:41,583
Did you sleep well last night?

13
00:00:41,583 --> 00:00:44,586
Yeah, thanks to you.

14
00:00:50,884 --> 00:00:53,887
Hey, Seung‑hyun...

15
00:00:54,972 --> 00:00:59,060
Can we slow things down?

16
00:01:00,889 --> 00:01:03,892
What do you mean?
Out of nowhere...

17
00:01:03,893 --> 00:01:06,103
This is still my workplace.

18
00:01:06,232 --> 00:01:08,818
People are watching.

19
00:01:08,818 --> 00:01:11,821
I just think it's better
we take it slow.

20
00:01:11,821 --> 00:01:14,824
So, inside the futsal center
let's just keep things...

21
00:01:14,824 --> 00:01:16,534
Hey there.

22
00:01:16,534 --> 00:01:19,287
Hope I'm not interrupting.

23
00:01:19,287 --> 00:01:23,458
Seung-hyun, could I
borrow you for a sec?
